message: "If you use this software, please cite the software release, the reproducibility dataset, and the associated manuscript."
title: "Growth, Pivoting, and Backward Error in the Purcell–Egerváry–Castillo Matrix Inverse"
type: software
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-03
license: MIT
authors:
