    family-names: Villatoro
    affiliation: Universidad de Málaga
repository-code: "https://github.com/FrancisRVillatoro/backward-error-purcell-egervary-castillo-matrix-inverse"
url: "https://github.com/FrancisRVillatoro/backward-error-purcell-egervary-castillo-matrix-inverse"
abstract: >-
  Frozen software and reproducibility materials for the numerical experiments
  accompanying the manuscript “Growth, Pivoting, and Backward Error in the Purcell–Egerváry–Castillo Matrix Inverse”. Version 1.1.0 adds an explicit
  LAPACK xGETRF+xGETRI production baseline, deterministic balanced-sample
  reconstruction, a strict six-method paired residual comparison, and
  metric-validity accounting, while preserving the original campaign,
  diagonal-dominance, defect-replay, and high-precision validation material.
keywords:
  - numerical linear algebra
  - matrix inversion
  - backward error
  - floating-point arithmetic
  - pivoting
  - Purcell method
  - Egerváry rank reduction
  - Castillo transformation
  - LAPACK
  - reproducible research
